			"notes": "Port to **Minecraft 26.3** (the current stable release).\n\n- Requires Minecraft 26.3, Fabric Loader >= 0.19.5, Fabric API 0.163.0+26.3, Java 25.\n- **New versioning scheme**: the mod version now tracks the Minecraft version it targets\n  (`1.26.3` for MC 26.3), replacing the old `0.9.x` numbering. Gameplay and content are\n  unchanged from v0.9.4.1.\n- Internal: 26.3 removed block codecs (`Block.codec()`/`simpleCodec`), so that boilerplate\n  was dropped from every block class.\n\nWorlds from v0.9.4.1 (MC 26.2) carry over - same `circuitsimcraft:` namespace; Minecraft\nupgrades the world format itself on first load. Back up any world you care about first."
		},
