			"notes": "Patch release. The Phase Bundler and Phase Unbundler previously shared the exact same\nshapeless recipe (3× Wire + 1 iron ingot), making them indistinguishable at the crafting\ntable — one of the two was effectively uncraftable normally. Both are now shaped and\nmirror each other:\n\n- **Phase Bundler**: iron ingot centered above a row of 3 Wire\n- **Phase Unbundler**: iron ingot centered below a row of 3 Wire\n\nAlso adds the previously-missing three-phase recipe diagrams to the README's Crafting\nrecipes table (all nine 3-phase components), and removes leftover debris from the old\n\"circuitcraft\" mod-id namespace (pre the 2026-08-09 rename) that had accumulated\nuntracked in the working tree."
		},
