			"notes": "Adds a Phase field to the Function Generator's value editor.\n\nThe Function Generator previously had no shift-right-click value editor at all — amplitude and frequency are relayed in from adjacent Voltage/Frequency modules, and phase was hardcoded to 0 for every waveform. Shift+right-click now opens an editor for **Phase** (0–360°), applying uniformly across all three waveform shapes (sine, square, and triangle), not just sine.\n\nsha256: `d666dab0a28b419d3b5f50cdfc66e9b8e2a4543fe04962622d60a0519af65642`"
		},
